cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use phenosuite-CLI in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "phenosuite-CLI: Command-Line Interface for PhenoSuite Spatial Omics Pipelines"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Esteva
    given-names: Eduardo
    affiliation: "Translational Immunology Center (TrIC), New York University"
repository-code: "https://github.com/e-esteva/phenosuite-CLI"
url: "https://github.com/e-esteva/phenosuite-CLI"
keywords:
  - spatial-omics
  - single-cell
  - multiplexed-imaging
  - CODEX
  - HPC
  - SLURM
  - command-line
  - bioinformatics
date-released: "2026-04-15"
abstract: >-
  Command-line interface for the core PhenoSuite pipelines, designed to
  run on SLURM-based HPC clusters. Bundles three independent
  spatial-biology modules: RunPhenomenalist (cellular scaling,
  dimensionality reduction, and clustering), masquerade (circular
  cluster-mask generation for QuPath overlays), and spatial-dynamics
  (pairwise log-odds and multi-cell-type neighborhood enrichment).
references:
